ed reads ← f05-15-evidence · security\n- ○ `f05-14-copies` Scan all retained private copies and scoped equality probes ← f05-14-cipher · security\n\n## Acceptance checks\n\n- ○ `g1-storage-behavior` not run — `node g1-storage/scripts/check.mjs`\n- ✓ `identity-behavior` pass · 2026-10-07T21:07:26+00:00 — `node g1-identity/scripts/check.mjs`\n- ✓ `foundation-behavior` pass · 2026-10-07T21:07:29+00:00 — `node g1-foundations/scripts/check.mjs`\n- ✓ `retained-baselines` pass · 2026-10-08T03:24:54+00:00 — `node g1-foundations/scripts/check-retained.mjs`\n\n## Reviews\n\n- ○ `security` (agent) pending\n- ○ `code` (agent) pending\n- ○ `final-acceptance` (agent) pending\n- ○ `product-acceptance` (agent) pending\n\n## Findings\n\n- `f-0da93b6091` [root_cause/recorded] Turn21 initial controller job-2f6365154f FAILauthority91/105(migration8/8). All11 head initial publication passes. Correction passed expected EntityRef incl witness to closed controlAudience(class,id,revision), causing correct INVALID_SCHEMA rollback + pending independent reservation; subsequent12ch\n- `f-037a8377e4` [root_cause/recorded] Second controller job-9ce5e057e0 authority101/105(migration8/8). All head children except concurrency pass, zero violation counters. Concurrency competitor legitimately sees pending independent witness before queued lookup; test now forces explicit post-COMMIT ACKgap and observes lookup enqueued fir\n- `f-33051f92f8` [root_cause/recorded] Third controller job-5bcbcad816 authority103/106,migration8/8,zero violation counters. All old checks, ordered concurrency and other headchildren pass. Two new test setups used actor0 scopeFor after unchanged legacy restriction-session child actually revoked its original fixture-held IdP session glo\n- `f-3e8e2d3fa2` [hypothesis/confirmed] Fourth controller job-a2b2981035 authority104/106,migration8/8,all prior+14head children pass,zero violation counters. Sole head-shared-controls child after all-class publication returns AUTHORITY_UNAVAILABL